    "created_at": "2021-07-22T07:56:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-22T07:56:33Z",
    "body": "> It doesn't seem to actually define the attribute itself or is that done elsewhere?\r\n\r\nIt defines it in as far as it `<dfn>`s it. But agree that it's not amazingly defined. I'm kind opening up for discussion who should own it, but I think it's confusing that we have SVG + HTML both defining it. \r\n\r\nThe [HTML spec says](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-aria-role):\r\n\r\n> The role attribute is defined in Accessible Rich Internet Applications (ARIA), as are the following roles: [ARIA]\r\n\r\nWhich leaves me feeling like it's underspecified. \r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
