    "updated_at": "2021-07-22T08:31:19Z",
    "body": "This also came up in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6810#discussion_r660073569.\r\n\r\nApart from who defines `role` (I guess we're ignoring the other ARIA attributes for now) there's a question as to where it works:\r\n\r\n* All elements, any namespace. I.e., is it superglobal and ought to be defined in DOM?\r\n* Global attribute for HTML, SVG, and MathML.\r\n* Something else?\r\n\r\nAnd then separately there's the question of who defines it. We don't have a good story at the moment for attributes (or elements) that are largely shared between HTML, SVG, and MathML.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
