    "created_at": "2024-03-11T17:12:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-03-11T17:12:37Z",
    "body": "ARIA dropped its `<dfn>` for the `role` attribute in 2022 (https://github.com/w3c/aria/commit/a56ae1818d0933145e6bf0b07c5884580d5f77b5), so I've filed https://github.com/w3c/aria/issues/2145 for them to figure out where the attribute should actually be defined. As I said there, I don't have a strong opinion, but other HTML folks might.",
